# Node modules - これが主要な問題の原因
**/node_modules

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build

# Git
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# IDE
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Test artifacts
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright
**/test-results
**/coverage

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Environment files (security)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# TypeScript build info
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Lock files are copied explicitly in Dockerfile
# pnpm-lock.yaml is needed, but others can be ignored
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock

# Documentation
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/LICENSE

# Temporary files
**/tmp
**/temp
**/.cache
